  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono grill to medium high heat.",
    "Cut the poblanos into 1 inch pieces and remove seeds and membranes.",
    "In a bowl, mix together poppy seeds, cumin, coriander, and a pinch of salt.",
    "Add the onion and garlic to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Thread the poblano pieces onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and season with lime juice.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with additional poppy seeds if desired."
  ],
